# Hydraulics Formula Handbook — product

Academic technical reference (read / search / calculate). **Not** a SaaS marketing landing.

## Design Read (declare before UI work)

`Reading this as: academic technical reference for engineering learners, editorial-minimalist, KaTeX + dense tables + sticky TOC.`

## Dials (taste-skill override)

| Dial | Value |
| --- | --- |
| DESIGN_VARIANCE | 3–4 |
| MOTION_INTENSITY | 2–3 |
| VISUAL_DENSITY | 6–7 |

## Locks

- One accent (deep teal / ink blue), one radius system, one page theme
- No AI-purple glow, cream–terracotta craft palette, or Inter/Roboto/Arial defaults
- Landing: brand + one headline + one abstract + one CTA — no stats/cards in first viewport
- Chapter: reading column (~65–72ch) + sticky TOC; **no cards wrapping equations**

